      "message": "fix(site): document Rotary Flow and resync the 0.27.0 icons\n\nThe release site tests were red on v0.27.0 and main, so the pages job\ndid not deploy. Add the op-rotary-flow and tool-form-mill icons and the\nupdated icon notice from assets/ui/, a Rotary Flow section with its\ntoolpath picture, and point the \"New tool…\" label check at the tool\nlibrary dialog list, where the button now lives.\n\nFixes #4106\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
